title: "AdaptTour: Real-Time Adaptive Tour Recommendation with Agentic AI"
abstract: >
  Real-Time Adaptive Tour Recommendation with Agentic AI. An LLM-driven agent
  that plans personalised tours and re-plans them on the fly as user context
  changes (weather, queues, fatigue, group preferences, venue hours).
